        "factor": "Historical base-rate: AfD has never won the most seats in BW",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "Long-run pattern strongly discourages AfD plurality in BW."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Electoral system and 5% threshold in a 120-seat BW Landtag",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Even with >5%, seat math tends to favor CDU/Greens; plurality requires outsizing both."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Convergence among major forecasts favoring CDU/Greens",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Multiple polls/forecasts agree CDU/Greens lead; AfD plurality remains unlikely."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Possible late campaign surge for AfD",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "A late swing could raise AfD share; but current data do not indicate such a surge."
      }
    ],
    "synthesis_rationale": "The final probability reflects applying strong downward updates from polls, base-rate, and institutional constraints, tempered by a modest upward update for a potential late surge. Given correlation among polls and forecasts, the updates are treated as partially overlapping; calibration caveats acknowledged. The resulting posterior is set at 1% with a conservative wide uncertainty range."
  }
}

